{"id":"cuento","lemma":"cuento","pos":"noun","rank":1220,"glosses":["story","tale, lie"],"ipa":"/ˈkwento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cuentos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cuento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Cuento con tu ayuda.","en":"I expect your help.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449839"},{"text":"No creo en cuentos de hadas.","en":"I don't believe in fairy tales.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586791"},{"text":"Te lo cuento luego.","en":"I'll tell you later.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/221747"},{"text":"Son cuentos de hadas para niños.","en":"They are fairy tales for children.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1061856"},{"text":"¿Nos cuentas un cuento?","en":"Could you tell us a story?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611963"}]}